0..77 Comment "// Two certificates no rule relates are not one path: the twin of the model\'s"
78..154 Comment "// `identified`. The circle\'s loop and the reflexivity at its point are both"
155..231 Comment "// paths from the point to itself, and nothing converts one to the other, so"
232..307 Comment "// the identification of certificates is the presented type\'s own paths and"
308..334 Comment "// not a quotient of them."
336..363 Comment "// The circle and its loop."
